  "honesty_boundary": [
    "This is an FFE kernel contract and packet ABI handoff plus one bounded 9943 target-level recovery, not a generalized ECDLP recovery.",
    "The contract does not evaluate summation polynomials or produce new direct/rank exports.",
    "The linear rank preflight is support-space only and does not make a direct/rank export claim.",
    "The source-gap preflight ranks replay targets but does not turn source proximity into a direct certificate.",
    "The sidecar coefficient preflight exports source coefficient forms for worker input but does not prove a backfill transfer.",
    "The backfill transfer gate binds source forms to missing row hashes but keeps accepted backfill exports at zero.",
    "The replay algebra probe classifies copied source-form solves as source-secret replay or inconsistent source mixes, not backfill exports.",
    "The fresh-emission packet binds worker obligations for fresh row emission but does not export direct/rank rows.",
    "The fresh materialization adapter binds support-scout rows to packet row hashes but does not turn unverified below-rho labels into relations.",
    "The direct verification audit classifies target verifier gaps but does not export direct/rank rows.",
    "The leaf augmentation worklist orders replay candidates but does not export direct/rank rows.",
    "The leaf augmentation replay probe records unverified rank/relation evidence but does not export direct/rank rows.",
    "The 9943 second-stage lattice probe exhausts visible leaf subsets but does not export direct/rank rows.",
    "The 9943 salt-neighbor carryover probe tests 9842 to 9943 leaf mutation but does not export direct/rank rows.",
    "The 9943 public-prefix expansion probe records a bounded target-level relation-derived export but does not prove a cross-target algorithm.",
    "The public-prefix min/transfer probe minimizes the 9943 export and derives 9981 only over rho, so it records portability evidence but not a generalized below-rho algorithm.",
    "The 9981 event-core gap-closure probe derives held-out 9981 below rho after minimizing accepted transfer events, but still does not prove a generalized ECDLP algorithm.",
    "The common leaf-pair sweep finds candidate-level below-rho relation-derived recoveries on 12 of 13 selected13 backfill transfers, but the sweep itself is not an end-to-end speedup because leaf selection is not predicted in advance.",
    "The common leaf predictor audit tests existing fixed public-prefix rankers and finds zero end-to-end-like selectors, so salt-conditioned FFE prediction remains required.",
    "No generalized or broad cross-target Pollard-rho speedup is claimed from these bounded artifacts alone."
  ],
